<title>CANADA: Printera bids for Laird Group.</title>
<headline>Printera bids for Laird Group.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printera Corp said on Wednesday it made a proposal to Laird Group Inc to amalgamate a unit of Printera with Laird.</p>
<p>Printera said shareholders of Laird will receive one common share of Printera for each 18 shares of Laird held, or C$0.14 in cash per Laird share held.</p>
<p>A meeting of Laird shareholders will be held on or about November 21 to consider the merger proposal, Printera said.</p>
<p>It said Laird has annual sales of about C$20 million.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
